joe biden's first foreign trip as  president marks a new phase  in the coronavirus pandemic and u.s  relations with the rest of the world  after a series of virtual meetings the  heads of the leading seven global  economies will meet face to face in the  uk  and this time there will be a u s  president who is less deliberately  disruptive  donald trump repeatedly confronted other  world leaders over trade  climate change and even the prospect of  bringing russia  back into the g7 group what  happened under the trump administration  is that it really shook a lot of  countries views  of the united states as a partner as an  ally  and part of biden's job is trying to  restore those ties restore that image of  the united states in the eyes of those  countries  president biden will also meet with nato  leaders an alliance donald trump talked  about leaving  he argued he was ready to push aside  traditions and fellow leaders  to deliver on his agenda trump spent  four years  tearing down nato criticizing um other  countries in europe  um suggesting the united states would be  better off without it why are we tied  down here etc etc  and so i think biden sees this as an  early opportunity  and an early public opportunity to  demonstrate his personal diplomatic  skills  the trump presidency questioned  challenged and upended  many traditional american political and  military positions  joe biden might be able to smooth over  the cracks  but he can't guarantee that things will  be that way after  the next election that relationships  that were taken for granted  will continue as they always have  biden's biggest challenge will be his  summit with russian president vladimir  putin a man he suggested is a killer  a man he believes is behind recent cyber  attacks on the u.s  a man who says america should prepare  for some uncomfortable truths at the  summit  there are no illusions about the state  of this u.s russia relationship so the  number one priority will be to at least  put this on a stable and predictable  track  needs to show that there are real costs  and that this is an administration that  will stand  up to russia's destabilizing behavior  world leaders hope their gathering will  send a message things are getting back  to  normal joe biden believes he is to send  the same message  after four years of donald trump  well alan fisher joins me now from the  white house alan i see biden now also  has a vaccine plan for the world  uh he's just left from joint air force  base  andrews heading to his summit  in the united kingdom he said as he left  that this was to show  china and russia that america and the eu  are united but there is a problem and  the problem is  over global vaccinations joe biden has  talked about waving global patents for  vaccinations the eu said hold on a  second that's a really bad idea first of  all it means that the people won't be  able to develop these vaccines for weeks  for months perhaps even years and also  it means that the intellectual property  rights for the drug companies  isn't protected they have an alternative  plan that they intend to show  to joe biden during the eu summit now  former leaders of many of the g7  countries have come together to say  that it's time for the eu and the g7 to  stand up and make sure  that poorer countries are vaccinated in  the words of one democratic congressman  while there is a threat  of covet somewhere in the world there's  a threat to covert  everywhere in the world and so they want  to make sure that both the eu  the g7 and the united states are on the  same page when it comes  to vaccinating the world joe biden as  you remember said that he intends to  give 25 million  that those doses of vaccine away by the  end of june  he'd like to see that number increase to  80 million as quickly as possible  it's a start for many but across the g7  and across the eu people believe that  there should be  a concerted plan to make sure that  poorer countries where vaccination rates  are two percent  or lower are given the chance of  catching up with the developed world  where these vaccines have been put  together  alan fisher there with all the latest  from biden's departure at the white  house thank you so much alan
 

